<title>FRANCE: Clarins first half sales rise 13.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Clarins first half sales rise 13.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of Francs unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover			 1,681.6 vs  1,485.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Cosmetics group Clarins released its results in a statement. It said sales rose 13.2 percent versus the same period a year earlier and that at constant exchange rates the rise was 8.5 percent. -- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
